### tdd.md Command 구조

```markdown
---
description: TDD workflow - write tests first
argument-hint: "[feature-description]"
allowed-tools: ["Read", "Write", "Edit", "Bash", "Glob", "Grep", "TodoWrite", "AskUserQuestion"]
---

# TDD Workflow

## Core Principles
- Test FIRST, code SECOND
- Small steps (Red → Green → Refactor)
- Use TodoWrite for 3+ steps

---

## Phase 1: Understand
## Phase 2: Write Failing Test
## Phase 3: Implement Minimal Code
## Phase 4: Refactor
## Phase 5: Repeat / Summary
```

### e2e.md Command 구조

```markdown
---
description: E2E test creation for user workflows
argument-hint: "[flow-description]"
allowed-tools: ["Read", "Write", "Edit", "Bash", "Glob", "Grep", "TodoWrite", "AskUserQuestion"]
---

# E2E Test Workflow

## Core Principles
- Test critical user journeys
- Use stable selectors (data-testid)
- Page Object pattern

---

## Phase 1: Identify Flow
## Phase 2: Plan Test Scenarios
## Phase 3: Implement Tests
## Phase 4: Run & Validate
## Phase 5: CI Integration
```

